        "notes": "Counts Conv1d, ConvTranspose1d, Linear, one-layer forward GRU matrices, bounded attention QK/AV and VQ nearest-neighbour search. Separately includes GRU gate products, Conv2Former modulation and conservative IRFFT/OLA estimates (5*N*ceil(log2N)+4*N per frame). Quantizer synthesis projections count toward decoder. MMAC fields exclude separately reported non-MAC products/FFT estimates. Excludes activations, normalization, padding and file I/O. Exception for grouped encoder: SnakeBeta explicitly includes36 operations/element (sin budget32 plus4 scalar operations) and65/channel/call (two exp budget32 plus negation). This is a conservative analytical convention, not measured transcendental latency. Total algorithmic delay includes10ms packet collection plus encoder lookahead; causal synthesis commits the current hop without next-frame buffering.",
